      "content": "$$\\left(H_0^{(0)} - V_n^{(0)}\\right)\\psi_n^{(3)} = W^{(3)}\\chi_{ns}^{(0)}\\phi_n^{(0)} - \\sum_{n'} F_{nn'}^{(3)}\\phi_{n'}^{(0)}, \\tag{52}$$",
      "confidenceScores": null,
